<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@300;700&family=Cinzel:wght@700&family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@700&family=Orbitron:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: "Zen Kaku Gothic New", sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #fff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        header {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .site-logo {
            width: 100px;
            height: auto;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
            padding: 5px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        /* --- 3分割コンテナ --- */
        .split-container {
            display: flex;
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .split {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.5s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }
        /* ホバー時の拡大率 */
        .split:hover { flex: 1.5; }
        
        /* --- 各メンバーの設定 --- */

        /* 1. 芹菜 (Left) */
        .serina-side {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 20, 30, 0.7), rgba(44, 20, 30, 0.7)), url('/images/serina_iori_yuzuki.png');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center 20%;
        }
        .serina-side:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.4), rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.4)), url('/images/serina_iori_yuzuki.png');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center 20%;
        }

        /* 2. 季都 (Center) */
        .kito-side {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.7), rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.7)), url('/images/kito_model_rei.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center top;
        }
        .kito-side:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.4), rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.4)), url('/images/kito_model_rei.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center top;
        }

        /* 3. KorDai (Right) */
        .kordai-side {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)), url('/images/kordai_banner.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }
        .kordai-side:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 188, 212, 0.4), rgba(0, 188, 212, 0.4)), url('/images/kordai_banner.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        /* タイポグラフィ */
        .name-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }
        /* フォントの使い分け */
        .font-serina { font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', serif; }
        .font-kito { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }
        .font-kordai { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; }

        .job-title {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .enter-btn {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 8px 25px;
            border: 2px solid #fff;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .split:hover .enter-btn {
            background: #fff;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* 中央テキスト */
        .center-text {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 5;
            pointer-events: none;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 400px;
        }
        .center-text h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 2px; }

        /* スクロール誘導 */
        .scroll-down {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 5;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 2rem;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
            text-align: center;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% {transform: translateY(0) translateX(-50%);}
            40% {transform: translateY(-10px) translateX(-50%);}
            60% {transform: translateY(-5px) translateX(-50%);}
        }

        /* 以下、チームセクション（既存と同じ） */
        .team-section { background-color: #111; padding: 80px 20px; color: #fff; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #333; }
        
        .team-title { 
            font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', serif; 
            font-size: 2.5rem; 
            margin-bottom: 10px; 
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d81b60, #007bff); 
            /* 修正箇所：標準プロパティを追加しました */
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text; 
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; 
        }
        
        .team-subtitle { color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 50px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .service-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .service-card { background: #222; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; transition: 0.3s; text-align: left; position: relative; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; }
        .service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); border-color: #666; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .service-card::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 4px; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #d81b60, #007bff); }
        .svc-title { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', serif; }
        .svc-price { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 20px; display: block; font-weight: bold; }
        .svc-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #ccc; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .svc-tags { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; }
        .tag { background: #333; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-right: 5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .contact-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 60px; padding: 15px 50px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d81b60, #007bff); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.2rem; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); transition: 0.3s; }
        .contact-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .split-container { flex-direction: column; height: auto; }
            .split { height: 40vh; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
            .scroll-down { display: none; }
            .center-text { top: 10%; width: 90%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="/">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="羽根いろの記憶" class="site-logo">
        </a>
    </header>

    <div class="center-text">
        <h1>CREATOR SELECTION</h1>
        <p>Select a Creator to View Works</p>
    </div>

    <div class="split-container">
        <!-- 1. Serina -->
        <a href="/portfolio/serina" class="split serina-side">
            <h2 class="name-title font-serina">Serina</h2>
            <div class="job-title">Illustration & Design</div>
            <div class="enter-btn">VIEW PORTFOLIO</div>
        </a>

        <!-- 2. Kito -->
        <a href="/portfolio/kito" class="split kito-side">
            <h2 class="name-title font-kito">Kito</h2>
            <div class="job-title">3D Modeling & Scenario</div>
            <div class="enter-btn">VIEW PORTFOLIO</div>
        </a>

        <!-- 3. KorDai -->
        <a href="/portfolio/kordai" class="split kordai-side">
            <h2 class="name-title font-kordai">KorDai</h2>
            <div class="job-title">Sound & BGM</div>
            <div class="enter-btn">VIEW PORTFOLIO</div>
        </a>

        <div class="scroll-down" onclick="document.getElementById('team-service').scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'})">
            <span class="scroll-text">Studio Works</span>
            ▼
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- チーム制作セクション -->
    <div id="team-service" class="team-section">
        <h2 class="team-title">Studio HANEIRO Production</h2>
        <p class="team-subtitle">季都 × 芹菜 × KorDai による、世界観統一・一括制作サービス</p>

        <div class="service-grid">
            
            <!-- 1. ゲーム開発 -->
            <div class="service-card" onclick="location.href='mailto:haneironokioku@gmail.com?subject=ゲーム制作・プロトタイプ開発の相談'">
                <div class="svc-title">🎮 ゲーム・プロトタイプ開発</div>
                <span class="svc-price">300,000円〜</span>
                <p class="svc-desc">
                    「あなたの企画を、動く形にします」。<br>
                    季都の高速実装力、芹菜の世界観構築、KorDaiのサウンド演出を合わせ、最短1ヶ月でプレイアブルな試作版を制作します。
                </p>
                <div class="svc-tags">
                    <span class="tag">UE5</span>
                    <span class="tag">3D Map</span>
                    <span class="tag">UI/Logo</span>
                    <span class="tag">Sound</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. VTuberスターターパック -->
            <div class="service-card" onclick="location.href='mailto:haneironokioku@gmail.com?subject=VTuberスターターパックの相談'">
                <div class="svc-title">✨ 3D VTuber デビューパック</div>
                <span class="svc-price">250,000円〜</span>
                <p class="svc-desc">
                    「身体」と「活動場所」と「声(BGM)」をワンストップで。<br>
                    3Dモデル・配信UI・専用BGMを一括制作。デザインと音の齟齬がなく、最高級のブランド力でデビューできます。
                </p>
                <div class="svc-tags">
                    <span class="tag">VRoid High-End</span>
                    <span class="tag">Logo/UI</span>
                    <span class="tag">Original BGM</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. ノベルゲーム -->
            <div class="service-card" onclick="location.href='mailto:haneironokioku@gmail.com?subject=ミニゲーム制作の相談'">
                <div class="svc-title">📖 短編・ノベルゲーム制作</div>
                <span class="svc-price">500,000円〜</span>
                <p class="svc-desc">
                    企業のPRや、個人の記念・頒布用ゲーム制作。<br>
                    シナリオ執筆からキャラデザ、システム、そして感動を呼ぶBGMまで全て丸投げ可能です。
                </p>
                <div class="svc-tags">
                    <span class="tag">Full Package</span>
                    <span class="tag">Scenario</span>
                    <span class="tag">Art</span>
                    <span class="tag">Sound</span>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <a href="mailto:haneironokioku@gmail.com?subject=チーム制作・スタジオ依頼の相談" class="contact-btn">チームへの制作依頼・相談はこちら</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>